                        "glosses": [
                            "Not reflective; thoughtless"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa178aaf-7299-4000-909d-2b00abf31612",
                                "sense_id": "bdec96ff-c9a8-31f7-a0f6-0cab4236cafc",
                                "text": "Is it not enough, at any rate, to strike the thing called ‘Fame’ into total silence for a wise man? For fools and unreflective persons, she is and will be very noisy, this ‘Fame’, and talks of her ‘immortals’ and so forth: but if you will consider it, what is she?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e50f8054-0061-4885-b7eb-03546d25853e",
                                "sense_id": "bdec96ff-c9a8-31f7-a0f6-0cab4236cafc",
                                "text": "But perhaps, too, it is worth recalling where hasty, unreflective action has taken us in recent years."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
